end
# turn 9: Wren is dead at 9,1 and the boss has 5 HP. The map is lost the way the eighth round said. First Recall, to the start of turn 8
recall 57
# turn 8 again: Wren opens from the hill side and the captain closes; the dice are the dice
move wren 9,1
attack wren mill_bandit-1
move captain 10,2
attack captain mill_bandit-1
end
# turn 9 again: same board, same dice, same death. The boss hits Wren for exactly half her HP, so she can never end a player phase beside him. Second Recall
recall 57
# turn 8, third time: the captain opens alone and takes both swings; Wren stays out of reach
